{'symbol': 'PANW', 'date': '2022-05-24 08:05:00', 'title': 'ORACLE CHOOSES PALO ALTO NETWORKS TO POWER OCI NETWORK FIREWALL', 'text': 'NEW NATIVE SECURITY SERVICE HELPS ORACLE CLOUD INFRASTRUCTURE CUSTOMERS PROTECT THEIR CLOUD APPLICATIONS AND DATA AGAINST EMERGING THREATS SANTA CLARA, CALIF. , MAY 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PALO ALTO NETWORKS (NASDAQ: PANW), THE GLOBAL CYBERSECURITY LEADER, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ORACLE HAS CHOSEN PALO ALTO NETWORKS VM-SERIES NEXT-GENERATION FIREWALL (NGFW) AS THE TECHNOLOGY TO POWER THE ORACLE CLOUD INFRASTRUCTURE (OCI) NETWORK FIREWALL.'}